  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Enabling activities for HFC phase-down in Serbia</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective of the implementation of the enabling activities is to allow for the early ratification of the Kigali Amendment and to help Serbia to fulfill their initial obligations with regard to HFC phase-down in line with the Kigali Amendment, in line with the ExCom Decision 79/46.</narrative>
  </description>
